# Suspicious Mshta Execution
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1218.005 (Signed Binary Proxy Execution: Mshta)
# Severity: High
# Description: Detects suspicious execution of mshta.exe with arguments typically used for Living off the Land (LotL) attacks.

index=windows OR index=endpoint
sourcetype IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational", "WinEventLog:Security", "XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-PowerShell/Operational")
Image="*\\mshta.exe"
(CommandLine="*javascript:*" OR CommandLine="*vbscript:*" OR CommandLine="*http://*" OR CommandLine="*https://*" OR CommandLine="*.xls*" OR CommandLine="*.doc*")
| stats values(CommandLine) as cmd by _time, host, user, Image, ParentImage, ParentCommandLine
| sort - _time
